{"description":"How could we build a Better Toronto?\nOn October 26th, every Torontonian will have the opportunity to express who they believe has the platform for a bolder city in the Toronto municipal election.\nJoin Build Canada & feature speakers as they discuss what they want to see from municipal candidates including transportation, housing, and safety.\nYou can see those ideas here: https://buildcanada.com/toronto/memos\nSpeakers will include:\nLucy Hargreaves, CEO & Co-Founder of Build Canada\nAdrian Rocca, CEO & Founder at Fitzrovia\nEric Richmond, Country Director / CEO at Coinbase Canada\nAbout Build Canada\nBuild Canada is made up of entrepreneurs, leaders, and motivated citizens, committed to driving Canada's growth.\nWe work with this community to build tools for civic engagement, publish bold policy ideas, and connect ambitious people.\nLearn more and join the movement on our website, and be sure to subscribe to our weekly newsletter to never miss a beat.","organizer":"Build Canada"}